#EXTM3U url-tvg=""

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# From Me To You — personal playlist
#
# group-title decides which section an entry lands in:
#   contains "movie" / "vod"    -> Movies
#   contains "series" / "show"  -> Series   (or a SxxExx tag in the title)
#   anything else               -> Live TV
# Put an entry in several categories with a semicolon: group-title="News;Business"
#
# Each entry is TWO lines: the #EXTINF metadata line, then the stream URL
# right below it (.m3u8 / .mp4 / .ts …). tvg-logo is the logo/poster.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ============================ LIVE TV ============================
#EXTINF:-1 tvg-logo="" group-title="Demo",Test HLS Stream
http://playertest.longtailvideo.com/adaptive/wowzaid3/playlist.m3u8

# ============================ MOVIES =============================
#EXTINF:-1 tvg-logo="" group-title="Movies",Big Buck Bunny
https://commondatastorage.googleapis.com/gtv-videos-bucket/sample/BigBuckBunny.mp4

# ============================ SERIES =============================
# Title format: "Show Name - S01E01 - Episode Title" so episodes group together.
# #EXTINF:-1 tvg-logo="" group-title="Series",My Show - S01E01 - Pilot
# https://your-host.com/series/myshow-s01e01.mp4

# ======================= YOUR LINKS BELOW =======================
# Send me your streams and I'll format them in here.
